(3517739, 492591, 76162, '<td valign="top">This is definitely my favorite in this challenge. I like the subject, composition, the way water reflection leads your eye to the curvy lines of the tree and the rays of sun, also the fact that straight lines are almost nonexistent in this picture. Light is very nicely balanced, enough details in the shadows are crucial for this picture. For me a 10.</td>', 'This is definitely my favorite in this challenge. I like the subject, composition, the way water reflection leads your eye to the curvy lines of the tree and the rays of sun, also the fact that straight lines are almost nonexistent in this picture. Light is very nicely balanced, enough details in the shadows are crucial for this picture. For me a 10.', '2007-04-04 06:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
