(3518306, 492643, 36382, '<td valign="top">The backlighting looks really nice on the leaves.  I think I might have been tempted to crop out the top light area.  I think it looks better that way.</td>', 'The backlighting looks really nice on the leaves.  I think I might have been tempted to crop out the top light area.  I think it looks better that way.', '2007-04-04 10:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
