(3518421, 491279, 73541, '<td valign="top">sometimes flares work in a picture... i think here it doesn''t. it''s not easy to get rid of them though. still good enough for an 8.</td>', 'sometimes flares work in a picture... i think here it doesn''t. it''s not easy to get rid of them though. still good enough for an 8.', '2007-04-04 11:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
