(3519555, 491824, 46885, '<td valign="top">Funny how there was another cute windmill two pictures ago. But this one feels more silouette. I feel silouettes are a cheaper version of contre-jour - the trick in the challenge, as I see it, to have more detail in the subject, while still having light source behind it.</td>', 'Funny how there was another cute windmill two pictures ago. But this one feels more silouette. I feel silouettes are a cheaper version of contre-jour - the trick in the challenge, as I see it, to have more detail in the subject, while still having light source behind it.', '2007-04-04 16:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
