(3519700, 492476, 50034, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but it''s missing the cardinal element of photography...Simplicity!  (I should know considering how many times I''ve "messed up" on this issue.)  IMHO you could "sell" the concept better by taking another photo as a close-up on one of the boughs focusing on a single bloom.  This particular photo could be improved by cropping out the right third of the photo (delete the two guys,) and by placing the lower right corner of the photo just behind &amp; lower than the lady''s heel with the upper left corner on the current sideline just outisde the "sky-opening" in the bough...IMHO.  Hope that helps somehow!  Cheers for your love of photography!  :)</td>', 'Nice photo, but it''s missing the cardinal element of photography...Simplicity!  (I should know considering how many times I''ve "messed up" on this issue.)  IMHO you could "sell" the concept better by taking another photo as a close-up on one of the boughs focusing on a single bloom.  This particular photo could be improved by cropping out the right third of the photo (delete the two guys,) and by placing the lower right corner of the photo just behind & lower than the lady''s heel with the upper left corner on the current sideline just outisde the "sky-opening" in the bough...IMHO.  Hope that helps somehow!  Cheers for your love of photography!  :)', '2007-04-04 17:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3519708, 490399, 50034, '<td valign="top">"Always on the way to shopping somewhere!"  That is the message of this photo, Right?!   :}  Score it a "7"...Except for overpowering highlights, it would have been an "8".  Sorry.  :(</td>', '"Always on the way to shopping somewhere!"  That is the message of this photo, Right?!   :}  Score it a "7"...Except for overpowering highlights, it would have been an "8".  Sorry.  :(', '2007-04-04 17:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
