(3521462, 489878, 68035, '<td valign="top">Oh my word, what a fantastic photograph.  I cannot even comprehend how you have got the moon so fantastically zoomed and yet you have not lost either the jet or even its vapour trails.<br/> <br/>You say luck but I am sure it is the old adage...the harder I work the luckier I get<br/> <br/>I appluad and envy you in equal measures</td>', 'Oh my word, what a fantastic photograph.  I cannot even comprehend how you have got the moon so fantastically zoomed and yet you have not lost either the jet or even its vapour trails. You say luck but I am sure it is the old adage...the harder I work the luckier I get I appluad and envy you in equal measures', '2007-04-05 05:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3521463, 492718, 49109, '<td valign="top">great interaction between the two! well cropped, like that you included the full shadows. the glaring light emphasizes the difference between the two body shapes and styles. overall a bit too pale, you should have pushed the contrast some - 8</td>', 'great interaction between the two! well cropped, like that you included the full shadows. the glaring light emphasizes the difference between the two body shapes and styles. overall a bit too pale, you should have pushed the contrast some - 8', '2007-04-05 05:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3521464, 492005, 68035, '<td valign="top">A great photo...and a shocking admission...for one millisecond (no make that a nano second) it did cross my mind..."wow...but it would be even better if the sun was in front of the bat" However I have decided not to subtract any marks for the fact that you did not get a baseball bat which was 150 million kilometers long<br/> <br/>Really like this image, great idea well executed</td>', 'A great photo...and a shocking admission...for one millisecond (no make that a nano second) it did cross my mind..."wow...but it would be even better if the sun was in front of the bat" However I have decided not to subtract any marks for the fact that you did not get a baseball bat which was 150 million kilometers long Really like this image, great idea well executed', '2007-04-05 05:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3521466, 492265, 49109, '<td valign="top">good color, composition and interesting subject. exposure is spot-on. slightly distracting halos from sharpening, still one of the best in challenge -9</td>', 'good color, composition and interesting subject. exposure is spot-on. slightly distracting halos from sharpening, still one of the best in challenge -9', '2007-04-05 05:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
