(3522382, 492451, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Meets the challenge well and is interesting to look at.  The gritty look and feel to this works well.  I''m not sure if it''s the processing or not, but his face seems a tad soft.  Some spot sharpening around the eyes might help, but that''s out of the question with Basic Editing ruleset.  All of the above is JMO of course. :D Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Meets the challenge well and is interesting to look at.  The gritty look and feel to this works well.  I''m not sure if it''s the processing or not, but his face seems a tad soft.  Some spot sharpening around the eyes might help, but that''s out of the question with Basic Editing ruleset.  All of the above is JMO of course. :D Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-04-05 14:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
