(3525493, 492721, 72318, '<td valign="top">hehe - i can see you... ;) Nice idea.</td>', 'hehe - i can see you... ;) Nice idea.', '2007-04-06 15:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3525514, 492659, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot except that the sun overpowers the image.  For me, it would have been more interesting to keep the sun completely behind the monument thus giving the rest of the image more weight.  Even so, this is a really nice shot.</td>', 'This is a great shot except that the sun overpowers the image.  For me, it would have been more interesting to keep the sun completely behind the monument thus giving the rest of the image more weight.  Even so, this is a really nice shot.', '2007-04-06 15:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3525611, 492636, 39679, '<td valign="top">I think I see what you were going for.  Shooting clouds into the sun is really tough.  Exposure is normally the biggest problem but your exposure here is pretty close.  However, the focus is way off and that will always kill a photo</td>', 'I think I see what you were going for.  Shooting clouds into the sun is really tough.  Exposure is normally the biggest problem but your exposure here is pretty close.  However, the focus is way off and that will always kill a photo', '2007-04-06 16:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3525618, 490591, 39679, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but the exposure is too dark.  I hope you''ll shoot this again and play with the exposure a bit.  I think You''ll have an interesting portrait.</td>', 'Nice composition but the exposure is too dark.  I hope you''ll shoot this again and play with the exposure a bit.  I think You''ll have an interesting portrait.', '2007-04-06 16:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3525627, 492638, 75440, '<td valign="top">cool perspective</td>', 'cool perspective', '2007-04-06 16:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3525628, 491414, 39679, '<td valign="top">Being a climber I understand that this might not have been possible but...<br/> <br/>A slight fill on the rock (increase exposure a little maybe), giving the rock some ''life'' while keeping the climber in silhouette would really have helped this shot.</td>', 'Being a climber I understand that this might not have been possible but... A slight fill on the rock (increase exposure a little maybe), giving the rock some ''life'' while keeping the climber in silhouette would really have helped this shot.', '2007-04-06 16:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3525631, 492591, 75440, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2007-04-06 16:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3525632, 492643, 39679, '<td valign="top">Good shot except that the sun flare is really distracting.</td>', 'Good shot except that the sun flare is really distracting.', '2007-04-06 16:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3525676, 491744, 68504, '<td valign="top">Too little to focus on.</td>', 'Too little to focus on.', '2007-04-06 16:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3525714, 491932, 30049, '<td valign="top">A 2 for 1, or just a popular place?  :D  Same location and time for a ''Free Study'' shot (that I happened to really like BTW).  :)<br/> <br/>This one is tough to grade for me personally, because the backlighting is not only strong, but wide.  I''m sure it fits the challenge theme correctly and such, but I''m kind of liking some of the images where the sun is a little more controlled.  Hope that makes sense.<br/> <br/>Compositionally, you''ve done a nice job capitalizing on the reflections in the water by positioning the structure in the upper third of the photo and leaving plenty of room for the water.<br/> <br/>All of the above is JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A 2 for 1, or just a popular place?  :D  Same location and time for a ''Free Study'' shot (that I happened to really like BTW).  :) This one is tough to grade for me personally, because the backlighting is not only strong, but wide.  I''m sure it fits the challenge theme correctly and such, but I''m kind of liking some of the images where the sun is a little more controlled.  Hope that makes sense. Compositionally, you''ve done a nice job capitalizing on the reflections in the water by positioning the structure in the upper third of the photo and leaving plenty of room for the water. All of the above is JMO of course.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-04-06 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3525718, 491956, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s TOO funny!  When I saw the thumbnail I thought the figure on the right was a large dog with it''s nose in the air.  :P<br/> <br/>I think you''ve timed this just right to get the strong backlighting, yet you haven''t blown out the image.  The silhouettes are well done here.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That''s TOO funny!  When I saw the thumbnail I thought the figure on the right was a large dog with it''s nose in the air.  :P I think you''ve timed this just right to get the strong backlighting, yet you haven''t blown out the image.  The silhouettes are well done here. Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-04-06 17:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3525727, 491896, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ah, yes.  The sun lighting the lamp.  :)  I have one of these floating around somewhere.  I''ll have to find it for afterwards.  He-he.<br/> <br/>This works well for the challenge.  You have nice cloud details (especially in the bottom).  Seeing some haloing around the lamp post that I don''t think is from backlighting (i.e. - sharpening?).  While looking at this with my lousy work monitor I''m seeing some compression artifacting in the sky area.<br/> <br/>Just some observations.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Ah, yes.  The sun lighting the lamp.  :)  I have one of these floating around somewhere.  I''ll have to find it for afterwards.  He-he. This works well for the challenge.  You have nice cloud details (especially in the bottom).  Seeing some haloing around the lamp post that I don''t think is from backlighting (i.e. - sharpening?).  While looking at this with my lousy work monitor I''m seeing some compression artifacting in the sky area. Just some observations.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-04-06 17:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3525737, 492555, 45857, '<td valign="top">good shot under difficult conditions</td>', 'good shot under difficult conditions', '2007-04-06 17:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
