(3530315, 490897, 30896, '<td valign="top">I suggest cropping the lower part to have it completely black. Then I would consider making the sky lighter and more contrasting with the foreground - but I actually tried without success as I always lost detail on the palm. As it is, the palms are great but the sky seems too and unevenly dark for me.</td>', 'I suggest cropping the lower part to have it completely black. Then I would consider making the sky lighter and more contrasting with the foreground - but I actually tried without success as I always lost detail on the palm. As it is, the palms are great but the sky seems too and unevenly dark for me.', '2007-04-08 16:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
