(3535123, 490644, 1647, '<td valign="top">You have the lightsource (sun) in the background of the image but there is no really obvious subject to this photo.  Ask yourself - What is this photo trying to say?  What emotion is it trying to generate?  Keep up the good work though and good luck on your next submission - this site is a great way to improve your photography skills.</td>', 'You have the lightsource (sun) in the background of the image but there is no really obvious subject to this photo.  Ask yourself - What is this photo trying to say?  What emotion is it trying to generate?  Keep up the good work though and good luck on your next submission - this site is a great way to improve your photography skills.', '2007-04-10 08:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
