(3535892, 492313, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of the photo.  You made your subject clearly stand out from the simple background.  I love the mood of the sky and the light waiting to come on.  Really nice!</td>', 'I love the simplicity of the photo.  You made your subject clearly stand out from the simple background.  I love the mood of the sky and the light waiting to come on.  Really nice!', '2007-04-10 15:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3535905, 490287, 42100, '<td valign="top">This one is pretty easy to overlook, but upon furthur inspection it definitely worth the time spent.  Using the sun to frame those little fuzzy things really works well.  Some very interesting textures to this as well.  Nicely done!</td>', 'This one is pretty easy to overlook, but upon furthur inspection it definitely worth the time spent.  Using the sun to frame those little fuzzy things really works well.  Some very interesting textures to this as well.  Nicely done!', '2007-04-10 15:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3535906, 490874, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the blue sky - nice rich color.  The water capture adds a nice element.</td>', 'I like the blue sky - nice rich color.  The water capture adds a nice element.', '2007-04-10 15:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3535909, 492659, 67697, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I love the light reflecting on the water.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I love the light reflecting on the water.', '2007-04-10 15:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3535911, 492676, 42100, '<td valign="top">The transition of color and tones through this is very cool.  Great job of making a very ordinary subject rather interesting.</td>', 'The transition of color and tones through this is very cool.  Great job of making a very ordinary subject rather interesting.', '2007-04-10 15:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3535912, 492265, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming this might be a candid shot?  Good find!  Great silhouette.</td>', 'I''m assuming this might be a candid shot?  Good find!  Great silhouette.', '2007-04-10 15:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3535915, 492644, 67697, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting.  What is that shining thing on the left.  The light source?  Just a slight distraction.  The shining cross at the very top is interesting!</td>', 'Love the lighting.  What is that shining thing on the left.  The light source?  Just a slight distraction.  The shining cross at the very top is interesting!', '2007-04-10 15:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3535917, 492424, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice photograph...just enough detail in the girl to keep her from becoming just a blah subject against that very bright background.  The natural framing and composition are outstanding.  Great job!</td>', 'Very nice photograph...just enough detail in the girl to keep her from becoming just a blah subject against that very bright background.  The natural framing and composition are outstanding.  Great job!', '2007-04-10 15:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3535922, 491391, 42100, '<td valign="top">The fascinating range of blues in this photo almost become the subject.  Very nice photograph!</td>', 'The fascinating range of blues in this photo almost become the subject.  Very nice photograph!', '2007-04-10 15:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3535926, 491457, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very intense color of sky, and very interesting detail from the clouds.  The silhouette looks great against that sky with the sun in perfect placement.  Well done!</td>', 'Very intense color of sky, and very interesting detail from the clouds.  The silhouette looks great against that sky with the sun in perfect placement.  Well done!', '2007-04-10 15:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3535933, 490465, 42100, '<td valign="top">There''s a subject that easily could fall into the dull/boring category, but those brightly colored ribbons give this photo an interesting twist of life and fun.  Nicely done!</td>', 'There''s a subject that easily could fall into the dull/boring category, but those brightly colored ribbons give this photo an interesting twist of life and fun.  Nicely done!', '2007-04-10 15:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3535935, 491287, 42100, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed silhouette...the placement of the sun is very good and gives this photo that little extra it needs.  Well done!</td>', 'Nicely composed silhouette...the placement of the sun is very good and gives this photo that little extra it needs.  Well done!', '2007-04-10 15:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3535938, 492457, 42100, '<td valign="top">The light apppears almost heavenly coming those leaves.  Very nice colors and tones in this photo.</td>', 'The light apppears almost heavenly coming those leaves.  Very nice colors and tones in this photo.', '2007-04-10 15:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3535944, 492702, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very dynamic color and texture to that sky.  Beautiful...gives me a warm, fuzzy and comforting feeling inside.</td>', 'Very dynamic color and texture to that sky.  Beautiful...gives me a warm, fuzzy and comforting feeling inside.', '2007-04-10 15:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3535950, 492593, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very good positions of the subject within this composition to give it a little life.  The sky gradient is very nice and I like how caught at least some of that warm, remaining sunlight.  Great job!</td>', 'Very good positions of the subject within this composition to give it a little life.  The sky gradient is very nice and I like how caught at least some of that warm, remaining sunlight.  Great job!', '2007-04-10 15:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3536043, 492718, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very lively and playful, as though the sun is energizing her spirit...but he looks a bit out of place with that premise.  Really like how you got the great highlighting and appropriate detail in the sides opposite the sun.  Well done!</td>', 'Very lively and playful, as though the sun is energizing her spirit...but he looks a bit out of place with that premise.  Really like how you got the great highlighting and appropriate detail in the sides opposite the sun.  Well done!', '2007-04-10 16:09:40.000000', NULL, 1);
