(3536112, 490031, 21304, '<td valign="top">Freakin´ AWESOME!!!! Doesn´t fit the challenge all to well.. but at this point, that really doesn´t matter - I know how hard it was to get this shot in the first place.<br/> <br/>Keep the mtb pics rollin´!!! I´m looking forward to seeing who took this shot!<br/> <br/>P.S - is that an Spec SX?</td>', 'Freakin´ AWESOME!!!! Doesn´t fit the challenge all to well.. but at this point, that really doesn´t matter - I know how hard it was to get this shot in the first place. Keep the mtb pics rollin´!!! I´m looking forward to seeing who took this shot! P.S - is that an Spec SX?', '2007-04-10 16:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
