(3537300, 490644, 72317, '<td valign="top">=)) Thanks for the welcoming and whatnot.. Yeah.. I could''ve done better.. This was really a last minute thing though. <br/> <br/>The ground and trees turned out darker than I would''ve liked and I don''t like that pink smudge... Whatever that is.. I didn''t edit the picture at all though.. So I''m somewhat satisfied with it. <br/>Thanks for the tips and support and whatnot.. I''ll do better next time. I promise. =)<br/>Thankyou for your votes.<br/>Oh my god I got two TENS. Someone rated it TEN! 8D<br/>XDD<br/>I love this site..</td>', '=)) Thanks for the welcoming and whatnot.. Yeah.. I could''ve done better.. This was really a last minute thing though.  The ground and trees turned out darker than I would''ve liked and I don''t like that pink smudge... Whatever that is.. I didn''t edit the picture at all though.. So I''m somewhat satisfied with it. Thanks for the tips and support and whatnot.. I''ll do better next time. I promise. =)Thankyou for your votes.Oh my god I got two TENS. Someone rated it TEN! 8DXDDI love this site..', '2007-04-11 01:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
