(3537405, 490253, 68504, '<td valign="top">Thought this would have done much better considering the conjunction of the 2 perfect silhouettes  -  the serendipity, and the perfect balance which reminds me of Japanese Brush Painting.  Possibly not punchy/showy enough for dpc.  Clone out those dust specks, and you''ve got a major classic print.</td>', 'Thought this would have done much better considering the conjunction of the 2 perfect silhouettes  -  the serendipity, and the perfect balance which reminds me of Japanese Brush Painting.  Possibly not punchy/showy enough for dpc.  Clone out those dust specks, and you''ve got a major classic print.', '2007-04-11 01:39:49.000000', NULL, 0),
