(3537527, 492449, 60862, '<td valign="top">Another great slice-of-life Deb shot.  And your composition is perfect.<br/> <br/>While normally people put subjects moving into the frame, I think this is great having her move out.  With the light, it makes it feel even more like a lonely station, and she''s eager to depart.</td>', 'Another great slice-of-life Deb shot.  And your composition is perfect. While normally people put subjects moving into the frame, I think this is great having her move out.  With the light, it makes it feel even more like a lonely station, and she''s eager to depart.', '2007-04-11 02:05:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3537531, 492367, 62815, '<td valign="top">Hi there<br/>I would like to describe you what is this.<br/>It is a piece of art in the subway of Athens .<br/>To capture this i was layed down to the floor and the piece of art hanging from the roof of the station.<br/>Thank''s for the votes</td>', 'Hi thereI would like to describe you what is this.It is a piece of art in the subway of Athens .To capture this i was layed down to the floor and the piece of art hanging from the roof of the station.Thank''s for the votes', '2007-04-11 02:06:50.000000', NULL, 0),
