(3539371, 492280, 19333, '<td valign="top">Thank all who voted and commented.<br/> <br/>What amazes me most is that Blue Moon guessed right about the inside of the car thing. Actually it doesn''t look that bat when spot edited.<br/> <br/>Es que estoy como el Betis, Fe ;-) Lo más gracioso es que la foto esta hecha sin mirar, con una G7 que iba estrenando! <br/>Y si, ha habido pocas cofradias y por eso no he puesto fotos de ningún nazareno este año.  ROFL!!</td>', 'Thank all who voted and commented. What amazes me most is that Blue Moon guessed right about the inside of the car thing. Actually it doesn''t look that bat when spot edited. Es que estoy como el Betis, Fe ;-) Lo más gracioso es que la foto esta hecha sin mirar, con una G7 que iba estrenando! Y si, ha habido pocas cofradias y por eso no he puesto fotos de ningún nazareno este año.  ROFL!!', '2007-04-11 13:05:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3539391, 491082, 63269, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, painful score there...I''m not entirely sure why it did so poor. I might suggest trying to get some more interesing composition, maybe. You could aso perhaps try to isolate a specific subject a little more - for example, next time try shooting just one branch in front of the light, and playing around with the composition. This has good potential though, I like the colors and the black shilouettes - it''s a very interesting shot! :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-17 20:50:06.</i></td>', 'Hmmm, painful score there...I''m not entirely sure why it did so poor. I might suggest trying to get some more interesing composition, maybe. You could aso perhaps try to isolate a specific subject a little more - for example, next time try shooting just one branch in front of the light, and playing around with the composition. This has good potential though, I like the colors and the black shilouettes - it''s a very interesting shot! :)', '2007-04-11 13:08:45.000000', '2007-04-17 21:50:06.000000', 0),
(3539430, 490270, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, I see ou''ve been bombed by comments, but I guess I''ll leave one to! :) This is cool - I like the bold shilouette and the colors - the sun peeking through is awesome! The dramatic sky is also really neat - I love the way it fades into complete black! I might suggest a slightly different point of view maybe. The composition isn''t all that exciting here, and there are a few slight distractions, such as the lamp. Otherwise, it looks great to me!</td>', 'Well, I see ou''ve been bombed by comments, but I guess I''ll leave one to! :) This is cool - I like the bold shilouette and the colors - the sun peeking through is awesome! The dramatic sky is also really neat - I love the way it fades into complete black! I might suggest a slightly different point of view maybe. The composition isn''t all that exciting here, and there are a few slight distractions, such as the lamp. Otherwise, it looks great to me!', '2007-04-11 13:17:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(3539470, 491083, 63269, '<td valign="top">I think the blue is just right! I have a feeling most DPC voters simply aren''t too big on abstracts like this. It''s very interesting!</td>', 'I think the blue is just right! I have a feeling most DPC voters simply aren''t too big on abstracts like this. It''s very interesting!', '2007-04-11 13:25:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3539496, 491083, 26255, '<td valign="top">Not too blue at all... the composition seems a bit heavy on the bottom and the focus seems a tad soft.  Perhaps a different angle (and no jet trail) would''ve helped a bit.</td>', 'Not too blue at all... the composition seems a bit heavy on the bottom and the focus seems a tad soft.  Perhaps a different angle (and no jet trail) would''ve helped a bit.', '2007-04-11 13:30:10.000000', NULL, 0),
