(3539557, 491083, 54778, '<td valign="top">I like the shot.. maybe the focus is indeed slightly soft.. Most people sharpen to the point of being a fault because that''s what the general voters want.. <br/> <br/>I think the framing of the sun the jet trail is very very good.. Perhaps more negative space at the bottom half would have made the whole composition less confined looking.. <br/> <br/>Abstract doesn''t do very well if competing against people shots or landscapes.. most people like pics that they can connect to.. <br/> <br/>And No it''s not too blue..</td>', 'I like the shot.. maybe the focus is indeed slightly soft.. Most people sharpen to the point of being a fault because that''s what the general voters want..  I think the framing of the sun the jet trail is very very good.. Perhaps more negative space at the bottom half would have made the whole composition less confined looking..  Abstract doesn''t do very well if competing against people shots or landscapes.. most people like pics that they can connect to..  And No it''s not too blue..', '2007-04-11 13:40:52.000000', NULL, 0),
