(3539903, 492449, 66635, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Can''t really explain all the feelings that it generates in me.  But it''s a fabulous shot.  I like that you have cut off her upper body.  It makes it more mysterious.  Love the B&amp;W.  Damn nice work.  I think you got robbed on the score.</td>', 'Love it!  Can''t really explain all the feelings that it generates in me.  But it''s a fabulous shot.  I like that you have cut off her upper body.  It makes it more mysterious.  Love the B&W.  Damn nice work.  I think you got robbed on the score.', '2007-04-11 15:09:27.000000', NULL, 0),
