(3540143, 492679, 66384, '<td valign="top">Muppet, I really like this image. It is quite emotive, and you look terrific against that window. The lighting is excellent. I like the very subtle colors, although it would probably be good in b&amp;w too. I gave it a 7 and am surprised it didn''t score a 6 in the final tally.</td>', 'Muppet, I really like this image. It is quite emotive, and you look terrific against that window. The lighting is excellent. I like the very subtle colors, although it would probably be good in b&w too. I gave it a 7 and am surprised it didn''t score a 6 in the final tally.', '2007-04-11 16:52:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3540149, 492449, 1993, '<td valign="top">I just finally got to look at the contre-jour shots.  I absolutely love this picture.  You should be at least in the top five!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-11 15:54:16.</i></td>', 'I just finally got to look at the contre-jour shots.  I absolutely love this picture.  You should be at least in the top five!!', '2007-04-11 16:54:04.000000', '2007-04-11 16:54:16.000000', 0),
(3540152, 490950, 61679, '<td valign="top">In responce to your forum thread, here is what I see in your challenge submittal.<br/> <br/>This image meets the challenge and you''ve handled the tough lighting conditions very well.  However, the main subject is dead center in the picture and the trees in the background are a distraction.  I would have also tried to isolate the main subject a bit more to remove the branches in the background and the trunk from the birch tree.  Overall, this image has the feel of "I could have shot that" instead of "How did they do that" or "I wish I had thought of that". <br/> <br/>Tim</td>', 'In responce to your forum thread, here is what I see in your challenge submittal. This image meets the challenge and you''ve handled the tough lighting conditions very well.  However, the main subject is dead center in the picture and the trees in the background are a distraction.  I would have also tried to isolate the main subject a bit more to remove the branches in the background and the trunk from the birch tree.  Overall, this image has the feel of "I could have shot that" instead of "How did they do that" or "I wish I had thought of that".  Tim', '2007-04-11 16:54:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3540168, 492201, 1993, '<td valign="top">Well, Jen.  I kind of like it.  I think it is a lot more interesting than some of the shots which beat yours out.  Keep on trucking, friend.  You have a good eye!</td>', 'Well, Jen.  I kind of like it.  I think it is a lot more interesting than some of the shots which beat yours out.  Keep on trucking, friend.  You have a good eye!', '2007-04-11 17:00:49.000000', NULL, 0),
