(3541260, 489878, 51747, '<td valign="top">Just an awesome shot! They say you make your luck and I''m sure you deserved this moment. Congrats on the top 5 and who the heck would vote this a 1 , 2 or 3  ??????</td>', 'Just an awesome shot! They say you make your luck and I''m sure you deserved this moment. Congrats on the top 5 and who the heck would vote this a 1 , 2 or 3  ??????', '2007-04-11 23:26:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3541350, 490591, 41556, '<td valign="top"><br/>Making her face dark was a creative choice.  I tossed the idea around over and over to go lighter or darker.  I guess I should have gone lighter.  I knew it wouldn''t be in the top 20 but I did think it would do better than it did.  Oh well,  still learning.  <br/> <br/>Thanks for the confidence boost rswank!<br/></td>', 'Making her face dark was a creative choice.  I tossed the idea around over and over to go lighter or darker.  I guess I should have gone lighter.  I knew it wouldn''t be in the top 20 but I did think it would do better than it did.  Oh well,  still learning.   Thanks for the confidence boost rswank!', '2007-04-12 00:05:36.000000', NULL, 0),
