(3541727, 491605, 42013, '<td valign="top">Fantastic perspective. Possibly a slightly lower camera position to move the light from behind her head, of course that would change the overall look of the model and I''m sure you didn''t bring her out to shoot for the DPC weekly challenge! Nice work and effective use of the wide angle.</td>', 'Fantastic perspective. Possibly a slightly lower camera position to move the light from behind her head, of course that would change the overall look of the model and I''m sure you didn''t bring her out to shoot for the DPC weekly challenge! Nice work and effective use of the wide angle.', '2007-04-12 02:17:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3541736, 491605, 57378, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by OmanOtter:</b></div><hr/><i> Great idea.  I like the horizontal gleam of shining sunlight behind her.  I love the shot.  Who is she? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It is Bethany Marshall from CNN<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by OmanOtter: Great idea.  I like the horizontal gleam of shining sunlight behind her.  I love the shot.  Who is she?   It is Bethany Marshall from CNN ', '2007-04-12 02:20:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3541891, 489878, 21669, '<td valign="top">That is quite spectacular, I missed voting on this challenge but I would have handed you a 10. should have ribboned IMHO. Well done nevertheless<br/></td>', 'That is quite spectacular, I missed voting on this challenge but I would have handed you a 10. should have ribboned IMHO. Well done nevertheless', '2007-04-12 04:43:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3542082, 492333, 57229, '<td valign="top">The <i>contre jour</i> effect makes it dark and dingey and it whispers ''Broadmoor'' to me. About 100% of the voters wouldn''t have made that sort of connection though, which is a shame, because it adds to the whole. Nice shot.</td>', 'The contre jour effect makes it dark and dingey and it whispers ''Broadmoor'' to me. About 100% of the voters wouldn''t have made that sort of connection though, which is a shame, because it adds to the whole. Nice shot.', '2007-04-12 08:23:48.000000', NULL, 0),
