(3543861, 491013, 50695, '<td valign="top">a stimulating mix of simple realism with a too-perfect arrangement of elements. I gave this a 7 and would have bumped it higher if I had had time. The title is perfect for this. It adds just the extra story needed.</td>', 'a stimulating mix of simple realism with a too-perfect arrangement of elements. I gave this a 7 and would have bumped it higher if I had had time. The title is perfect for this. It adds just the extra story needed.', '2007-04-12 19:53:17.000000', NULL, 0),
