(3548925, 492440, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is really awesome! I can tell that it actually is agianst the light, by looking at the hand...although I guess it may have been hard for some people to realize. That''s too bad. :(<br/> <br/>This is a really beautiful photo! It may not necessarily remind me of "flowing" water, but the mood and atmosphere does remind me of "water." Clear, sparkling, and crisp! Anyways, I REALLY love this! That star filter is really awesome!</td>', 'This is really awesome! I can tell that it actually is agianst the light, by looking at the hand...although I guess it may have been hard for some people to realize. That''s too bad. :( This is a really beautiful photo! It may not necessarily remind me of "flowing" water, but the mood and atmosphere does remind me of "water." Clear, sparkling, and crisp! Anyways, I REALLY love this! That star filter is really awesome!', '2007-04-15 09:58:04.000000', NULL, 0),
