(3549514, 492501, 29906, '<td valign="top">Oh man, I am sorry you got hammered like that in your first challenge. I agree with some of the comments that the photographic quality of the photo is not that high, but it certainly doesn''t deserve the low score.<br/>Some voters will just vote 1 on any photo that contains nudity regardless of anything else. Don''t be discouraged by those kind of close-minded people, I wish you luck in your future challenges.</td>', 'Oh man, I am sorry you got hammered like that in your first challenge. I agree with some of the comments that the photographic quality of the photo is not that high, but it certainly doesn''t deserve the low score.Some voters will just vote 1 on any photo that contains nudity regardless of anything else. Don''t be discouraged by those kind of close-minded people, I wish you luck in your future challenges.', '2007-04-15 16:21:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3549533, 492402, 52285, '<td valign="top">thanks everybody<br/> <br/>@gattamarta: not really, I liked it a lot even if it does not have much to do with the contest theme, so i didn''t even think to crop it; and, in any case, had I chosen to esclude the floor (this could result in a more neat composition) I had to do it when shooting, i.e. lowering the camera in the floor, but i didn''t think about it at the time<br/> <br/>thanks again to everybody<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-04-15 15:37:15.</i></td>', 'thanks everybody @gattamarta: not really, I liked it a lot even if it does not have much to do with the contest theme, so i didn''t even think to crop it; and, in any case, had I chosen to esclude the floor (this could result in a more neat composition) I had to do it when shooting, i.e. lowering the camera in the floor, but i didn''t think about it at the time thanks again to everybody', '2007-04-15 16:36:39.000000', '2007-04-15 16:37:15.000000', 0),
(3549627, 492501, 74862, '<td valign="top">The exposure and saturation of this photograph, not to mention the subject matter, is very stylish. It has a magazine editorial feel - like Terry Richardson from vice, or The Fader or something like that. I''m not sure if that''s what your intent was, but many people on here won''t get that. They only give high marks to photos of the aurora borealis that were taken in Iceland or cheesy, over sharpened, overly set-up photos.</td>', 'The exposure and saturation of this photograph, not to mention the subject matter, is very stylish. It has a magazine editorial feel - like Terry Richardson from vice, or The Fader or something like that. I''m not sure if that''s what your intent was, but many people on here won''t get that. They only give high marks to photos of the aurora borealis that were taken in Iceland or cheesy, over sharpened, overly set-up photos.', '2007-04-15 17:31:34.000000', NULL, 0),
