(3551312, 489878, 31456, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. Best I would have done, even with a perfect lens, is probably an out of focus moon behind a moving blur of a plane. Amazing.<br/> <br/>And for my rant: People, stop voting low because they think "it''s not real" and judge the photo for its artistic qualities and how well it fits the challenge. Even the title of the image includes <b>Luck</b>. Leave the technical stuff to those in charge. It''s a real photo, and the few voters scoring it very low stripped it of the ribbon it should have received.</td>', 'Excellent capture. Best I would have done, even with a perfect lens, is probably an out of focus moon behind a moving blur of a plane. Amazing. And for my rant: People, stop voting low because they think "it''s not real" and judge the photo for its artistic qualities and how well it fits the challenge. Even the title of the image includes Luck. Leave the technical stuff to those in charge. It''s a real photo, and the few voters scoring it very low stripped it of the ribbon it should have received.', '2007-04-16 09:35:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3551824, 491481, 29293, '<td valign="top">very nice!</td>', 'very nice!', '2007-04-16 11:53:03.000000', NULL, 0),
