(3560932, 490550, 64994, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, for my taste I would rather it be just white black and blue, the pinkish hues on the clouds kinda detract from it for me, in levels you can hit the pull down and select red then desaturate until they disappear. I think this is legal in basic, anyway just a thought. Nice shot though and love the blue in this!</td>', 'Cool shot, for my taste I would rather it be just white black and blue, the pinkish hues on the clouds kinda detract from it for me, in levels you can hit the pull down and select red then desaturate until they disappear. I think this is legal in basic, anyway just a thought. Nice shot though and love the blue in this!', '2007-04-18 20:57:46.000000', NULL, 0),
