(3593460, 491515, 72317, '<td valign="top">Hey, for your first submission this is fine.<br/>You might want to try to photograph things that other people will find interesting.<br/>I have trouble with that as well.<br/>If you take a picture that you like but you don''t think others will like, try getting a portfolio and keeping it there.<br/>For challenges, put as much effort into it as you can.<br/>You did fine.<br/>=P</td>', 'Hey, for your first submission this is fine.You might want to try to photograph things that other people will find interesting.I have trouble with that as well.If you take a picture that you like but you don''t think others will like, try getting a portfolio and keeping it there.For challenges, put as much effort into it as you can.You did fine.=P', '2007-04-29 23:39:04.000000', NULL, 0),
