(5192391, 492449, 67697, '<td valign="top">ooh one I have never commented on!  But I did vote on it and gave it a 7.  I love that she''s a silhouette but you still captured the details in her shoes!  Great moment too, with her one toe pointed down.  It''s almost like she''s dancing.  A simple photo that says a lot - I like!</td>', 'ooh one I have never commented on!  But I did vote on it and gave it a 7.  I love that she''s a silhouette but you still captured the details in her shoes!  Great moment too, with her one toe pointed down.  It''s almost like she''s dancing.  A simple photo that says a lot - I like!', '2009-01-15 08:29:50.000000', NULL, 0),
